{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17102340","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17102340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710234001:1":{"text":"부인, 핸드백 받으세요.","source_cn":"夫人，您的手袋在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21668EF38E5C56CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710234002:1":{"text":"정말 믿을 수가 없어요. 레오프론 제국의 심장이라는 수도 사바나에 이렇게 야만적인 동물이 나타나다니!","source_cn":"哦，真是难以置信——在耀光帝国的中心，王都赛凡纳竟会出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF69E9DBC9ECE158","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710234003:1":{"text":"헨드릭 사령관의 따님인 귀네스 경이 계셔서 다행입니다. 정말 대단한 실력이군요!","source_cn":"幸好有亨德里克司令家的格温妮丝在场，没想到她还有这般本事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A08F8365BC742B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710234004:1":{"text":"정말 멋진 한 발이었습니다!","source_cn":"刚才格温妮丝队长那一箭！太漂亮了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x572A14A797CA341D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710234005:1":{"text":"사람들이 다시 술렁이기 시작했고, 귀네스가 인파를 가르며 이쪽으로 걸어오고 있었다.","source_cn":"人群又开始骚动起来，你发现格温妮丝已经穿过人群，向你们...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDDD22BA666AB2251","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"사람들이 다시 술렁이기 시작했고, 귀네스가 인파를 가르며 이쪽으로 걸어오고 있었다.","female":"사람들이 다시 술렁이기 시작했고, 귀네스가 인파를 가르며 이쪽으로 걸어오고 있었다.","variant_male_record_index":"228053","variant_female_record_index":"228054","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710234006:1":{"text":"저... 정말 귀네스 님이야! 너무 멋지다!","source_cn":"是……是真的格温妮丝！好酷！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82B7C5A440F35946","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710234007:0":{"text":"카이로렌 백작님, 핸드백을 살펴보시고 혹시 잃어버리거나 망가진 물건이 있는지 확인해 주세요.","source_cn":"凯洛伦伯爵。请您清点手袋，确认是否有财物损坏或遗失。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E57F3CD65B1E99C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710234008:0":{"text":"전혀 없어요! 정말 다행이군요.","source_cn":"一点都没有！真是万幸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4228BB1D124377FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710234009:1":{"text":"귀네스 경, 활 솜씨가... 정말 대단하군요.","source_cn":"格温妮丝小姐，你的箭术……着实令人惊叹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF24FC16D77C26B4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710234010:1":{"text":"조만간 헨드릭 사령관님을 직접 찾아뵙고, 찬사와 감사를 전하겠습니다.","source_cn":"月内我定会择日拜访令尊，亲自表达我的赞赏与感谢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06E32F76D3F278E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710234011:1":{"text":"과찬이십니다. 제 본분일 뿐이니, 굳이 사령관님께는 알리지 않으셔도 됩니다.","source_cn":"夫人，您过誉了。这只是守备军的职责所在，不必特意告知司令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEC6E27A8C09847A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710234012:1":{"text":"코로, 원숭이로 인해 입은 피해나 다른 부상자가 있는지 확인하도록.","source_cn":"孔罗，去检查那只猴子是否还造成了其他损失或有人受伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x113FC09279266569","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710234013:0":{"text":"네, 분대장님!","source_cn":"是，队长！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D4FCE5D0298B656","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710234014:1":{"text":"하아, 축제 첫날부터 이런 사고라니. 정말 지치네요.","source_cn":"唉，在庆典首日便遭遇这等意外，着实令人心力交瘁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D5A57FD5E0145F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710234015:1":{"text":"카라, 몸이 불편해서 돌아가 쉬어야 할 것 같으니, 오늘 퍼레이드에 참석하기 어려울 것 같다고 전하거라.","source_cn":"卡拉，传我的话，就说我略感不适，需回府歇息，不便观看今...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16CCA81FA78E4D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1710234016:1":{"text":"네, 부인. 먼저 댁으로 모셔다드린 뒤, 집사를 보내 사과의 말씀을 전하도록 하겠습니다.","source_cn":"是，夫人。请容我先护送您返邸，再由管家出面传达您的歉意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2157E25414E9BE12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1710234017:1":{"text":"귀네스 경, 다시 한 번 감사해요. 이후에 궁에서 다시 뵙도록 하지요.","source_cn":"格温妮丝小姐，今日多谢你的及时援手。我们之后宫中再会吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5953932244DBB6DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1710234018:0":{"text":"안녕히 가십시오, 카이로렌 백작님.","source_cn":"恭送您，凯洛伦伯爵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD20FAAE011E5E14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1710234019:2":{"text":"저, 저기... 귀네스 님! 아까... 저, 정말 멋있었어요!","source_cn":"那个……格、格温妮丝！刚才那一箭……超、超级帅气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A2955135BCFC23C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1710234020:1":{"text":"저도 활쏘기에 도전해 보려고요! 드래곤 인형이 갖고 싶거든요. 저도 귀네스 님 같은 기사가 될 거예요!","source_cn":"我也要去参加射箭挑战……我也要赢下那个龙玩偶！我也想成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x416EA6B18EE7C1F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1710234021:1":{"text":"그럼 열심히 해야겠네? 좋은 소식을 기다릴게.","source_cn":"很有志气，那你要加油了。我等着听你的好消息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82F7A1204EBFD3AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1710234022:1":{"text":"네! 꼭 해낼 거예요!","source_cn":"嗯！我一定可以的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF995C0DB2BCD8538","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1710234023:1":{"text":"귀네스의 격려를 받은 릴리는 신나게 환호성을 지르며, 즐거워진 새처럼 활쏘기 노점을 향해 달려갔다.","source_cn":"得到了格温妮丝的鼓励，莉莉兴奋地欢呼了一声，转身像只快...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x590F4175A44E49DB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"귀네스의 격려를 받은 릴리는 신나게 환호성을 지르며, 즐거워진 새처럼 활쏘기 노점을 향해 달려갔다.","female":"귀네스의 격려를 받은 릴리는 신나게 환호성을 지르며, 즐거워진 새처럼 활쏘기 노점을 향해 달려갔다.","variant_male_record_index":"228076","variant_female_record_index":"228077","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗万":{"text":"로완","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:女伯爵凯洛伦":{"text":"카이로렌 백작","source":"女伯爵凯洛伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军孔罗":{"text":"근위대원 코로","source":"守备军孔罗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小孩莉莉":{"text":"아이 릴리","source":"小孩莉莉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:侍女卡拉":{"text":"시녀 카라","source":"侍女卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_